      |                             |\
      | (D3)       (D4)       (D5)  |\
      +--|----------|----------|----+\
         |          |          |\
         v          v          v\
    [PWM MODULE] [RELAY 1]  [RELAY 2]\
      (0-10V)     (TORCH)   (POT GND)\
